00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:51.880
It is complete! Abeno King!

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:55.890
Oh, we're done hooking up.

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:56.960
What the heck?

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.060
Hooking up just meant becoming a robot? That's so stupid.

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:03.500
What d'you say, Arumi?! Don't you get how incredible this is?!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.000
I don't care. But where're ya talking to me from?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.760
Hey, Arumi.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.010
Get that ass outta my way!

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.780
Don't look! Don't touch!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.300
What are you doing?!

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.040
Enemy approaching!

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.350
Don't play with that!

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:23.250
Come on, Arumi, you're in my way! Move it!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:25.220
I'm stuck!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:28.710
I hate this!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.290
Hold on a sec!

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:34.760
Didn't we just do a pretty nifty ultimate technique?!

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:36.620
And we threw it without even yelling anything!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:40.470
Who cares about that?! Hurry up and get me unstuck!

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:41.700
Your ass is heavy!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:42.580
There!

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:44.040
Enemy approaching!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.740
Okay, we'll take turns doing moves.

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:47.810
You just did one, so I'll do the next one.

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:49.010
Do whatever you want.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.600
Let's see.

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.380
Launch Missiles!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:53.840
Whoa!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.390
Something Or Other Jump!

00:15:56.650 --> 00:15:58.770
Whatchamacallit Landing!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.020
Say, do we absolutely gotta yell these out?

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.820
It's harder than I thought to come up with 'em on the spot...

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:04.890
...but it's probably better to have 'em!

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:05.690
Okay.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:08.230
Top Notch Half Price Sword!

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.490
Round-Edge Kitchen Knife Throw!

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.820
Stock Clearance Tackle!

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:23.580
Arumi, you gotta take turns! Lemme say some, too!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.310
Hey, it won't move now, even if I push the lever.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:27.920
Enemy approaching!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:34.840
Hey, wait! Isn't that the head decoration?!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.510
I'm telling you, it's not a weapon!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.550
Take that!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:43.260
Shoot! This looks like an ultimate technique!

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.650
Hurry! Hurry! This time...

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:49.020
Final Lightning Mega Flash Thunder!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.440
What the heck is this?

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:58.610
Hi!

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:02.250
Mune-mune-san! And Nee-san!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:05.090
Aki-neechan, you don't look good, no matter what you wear.

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:07.610
Those voices! You're the kiddy duo we met earlier!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.350
We don't have any panties!

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.750
It's night, so we're space pirates now!

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.430
Since we're doing this, we gotta do something bad.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.400
We've wrecked this area quite a bit...

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.060
...so don't you think we've done a good deal of bad things?

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.140
We're pirates, so maybe we should go look for some treasure!

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:25.160
What?! That goblin is still alive?!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.110
I can read its mind!

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:34.610
"I have grown weak, so I will merge with the ship that crushed me...

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:40.660
...and take hostages to get my revenge."

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.150
Mune-mune-san is...

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:10.150
What's going on?!

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:14.320
That damn goblin merged with Mune-mune-san's ship and took it over!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.490
Why you!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:26.700
It's no good!

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:29.330
With a tiny robot like ours, we're as effective as a mosquito stinging it!

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:33.170
Did you see the might of the Great Evil Space Lord?!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.180
Yay! It's Great Evil Space Lord this time?

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.420
Mune-chan, you're really into this!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.950
What's the shining stuff on the display?!

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:43.750
Never mind it! Just get to the middle of the shopping arcade!

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:44.470
Grandpa!

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:48.060
Remember the shops in the shopping arcade that maintain the harmony of the four gods?!

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.960
When the Abeno King stands at the point where the four gods intersect...

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:54.930
...the legendary power slumbering in Abenobashi Shopping Arcade will be awoken!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:56.570
Forget that! Gimme my panties back!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:19:00.530
All right! I'll use that so-called legendary power!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.910
It's cheap, it's cheap, it's cheap!

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.020
Yay!

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:18.630
Cheers to our Great Evil Space Lord's victory!

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:19.930
There you go.

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:21.390
Party! Party!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:26.350
What?!

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:28.020
What in the world is that thing?!

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:33.060
Behold! This is the universe's greatest! Abenobashi Shoppingkaiser!

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:35.830
The legendary giant has been activated!

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.840
You guys have no hope of winning!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:39.470
Surrender quietly!

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:43.700
You cowardly bastards, coming at us while when we're hung over!

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:46.210
Ignore them! Prepare to fire the wave cannon!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:47.710
Fire!

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.750
Shoot, the enemy has fired the wave cannon at us.

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:52.720
Anti-air defense! Face, open!

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.630
Ascending Fire!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:03.920
Space Destroy Energy detected. It's off the charts.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:06.670
Space Destroy Energy?

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:08.640
The power to destroy the universe?!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.540
We're a big lump of Space Destroy Energy over here!

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.040
You can't touch us that easily!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:15.690
Why you!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:19.340
Hey, those're my panties!

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:23.450
Charge!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:28.540
Wait! If you blow them up, the universe will do that thing and be annihilated!

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:34.520
Go!

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.080
Mune-mune-san!

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:58.320
Panties!

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:01.620
Isn't it sort of hot?

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:04.720
Well, so long.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:08.330
Hey, thanks for your business as always!

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:12.000
I did it! I did it!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.290
I've finally got it!

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:14.290
I caught the goblin here...

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:17.470
My panties came back to me.

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:18.310
Oh, you broke them all. I'm going home.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.030
So long.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.010
Hey, goblin, hurry it up!

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.250
You know what's coming if ya cut corners again.

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:30.610
It'll be totally okay pyui.

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:32.510
All things extant in this world...

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.920
...gods of Heaven, gods of Earth, let them be as they should be.

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:39.180
Thus shall it be!

00:21:40.390 --> 00:21:42.190
I forgot the offerings pyui.

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:02.540
C'mon, Arumi, calm down, okay?

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:08.420
That goblin! It cut corners again!

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:12.360
I'm gonna kill it this time!

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:10.520
So, where are we?

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:12.360
Ni hao.

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:48.520
This time, I'm really gonna do a next episode preview!

00:23:48.520 --> 00:23:49.090
Yes, yes.

00:23:49.090 --> 00:23:50.160
Don't interrupt me anymore.

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:51.830
When did I ever interrupt you?

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:52.790
You've been interrupting me the whole time!

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:56.360
Every time I tried to say something, you'd come jabbering in from the side...

00:23:56.360 --> 00:23:58.170
...and I'd always run out of time!

00:23:58.170 --> 00:23:59.070
Are you sure 'bout that?

00:23:59.070 --> 00:23:59.800
Yeah, I'm sure!

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:01.940
Think back, you've got a tendency to do that, Arumi.

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:03.340
You might not realize it...

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:05.540
...but once you open your mouth, you tend to keep going, ya know?

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:07.540
People from Osaka are all like that in some way...

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:10.780
...but you've got a mile wide streak of it, so I think you should watch it.

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:11.950
Oh, I see.

00:24:11.950 --> 00:24:13.180
You get me?

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:14.520
There's no time left.

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:15.310
What?
